{
 "format": 1,
 "about": "The AE starter pistol pack: the Digsite mod's 00_e3 pistol (the official Halo CE Mod Tools' digsite/weapons/pistol/00_e3: its third-person and first-person models, animations, collision, shaders, textures, sounds, effects, round, damage effects and reticle) as an Xbox weapon tuned as AE's starter sidearm: one precise round a pull, a small 1.5x zoom, a tight first shot and a wide bloom when the trigger is held, a killing head shot after the shield. Numbers (AE's 75 + 75 player, headshots as the rifles' profiles use them): 24 a round within 15 units (falling to 20 at 35 units: four hits and a head shot still kill there, six to the body), x1.0 on a shield (three hits leave 3 of its 75: none of the third hit carries through, so the third is never a head kill) and x1.75 on the body (42): four hits kill with the last to the head, five to the body, 3.4 rounds a second (a pull every 9 ticks: a head kill 0.88 s, a body kill 1.18 s, the stock pistol's pace), 12 a magazine, 48 at first, 72 at most, error 0.1 to 2.5 degrees reached in 0.35 s of a held trigger (0.25 s back: paced shots stay on the dot), a 1.5x zoom (one level), aim assist 2.5 degrees to 15 units, magnetism 6 degrees to 18, the round 2000 units a second to 60 units, the stock pistol's melee. The Digsite suit HUD and ammunition panel are left out (the map's classic rounds panel draws the ammunition); The aiming reticle is the stock pistol's at 0.7 of its size (red on a target; no zoomed overlay or \"2x\" label). make_pack.py runs it; the locations of the source zip (a zip of the allowlist's tags from the Mod Tools), the stock map and the programs are given on its command line (--zip).",
