   "why": "the starter pistol's round: Digsite's damage effect (its impacts, materials, stun, can_cause_headshots) at AE's numbers: 24 a round within 15 units (20 from 35 units: the round's falloff; four hits still break the shield there, a body kill takes six), x1.0 on a player's shield and x1.75 on the body (42): three hits leave 3 of the 75 shield, so no damage carries through and the third hit is never a head kill (the game kills on a head hit whose shield-breaking round carries any damage through: 25 or more a hit makes the third a kill, as the stock pistol's three); the fourth breaks it and carries 21 (36.75 on the body): a head kill is four hits, a body kill five (36.75 + 42)"
  },
  {
   "layer": "fix-ae",
   "tag": "digsite/weapons/pistol/00_e3/h pistol bullet.projectile",
