   "why": "Digsite's round (2000 units a second, no drop) with its range cut from 100 to 60 units, as a starter weapon's, and a falloff (owner 11-09: \"a slight nerf especially at distance\"): it slows from 2000 to 1000 units a second between 15 and 35 units, and its damage follows its speed from 24 down to the damage effect's minimum of 20"
  },
